<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Yudasa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yudasahe Sowi Ewe Seleba Ufulu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yudasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="rem">First draft by the team in February 2018, with Johann Alberts as exegetical advisor.</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor Check with Wabele Fuga, Yobe Maibi and Dickson Wadaga in November 2022.</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant Check by correspondence by Paulus Kieviet, 2023</para>
  <para style="mt">Yudasa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yudasahe Sowi Ewe Seleba Ufulu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Sowi eweda selelumo, Yudasa. Dawalolo inolo noolo hilisesia, Yudasa ewe, Yesune elewo no e-bileba hilisebu. Yudasa Isakaliodo Yesuda holonolumo, amo inolo no. Fogo ami, Yudasane enesaiyo wedinale alolu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sulu e sowi ami selelu ewe, Fida e sowi aganebo selelu amodai, aalifaba imini ule aiba dobu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yudasa sowi usu selelu amone sulu olaibo, ewe. Keliso idele inolo ili asigi ule ufulufealo amo kiwigaaba kalugaeyo dobu. Idele inolo Godefea faiso mefemo, ili noolo sese usu ami sugafia, masega sulu walelo. Aulugulu, sigidubulu idele inolohe masega sulu amo kuliba anosi, Yudasahe ilifea hagugulu sulu solu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mad 13.55</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na Yudasa. Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu moloba ofolo inolo</char> uleno, na lolu. Aufia, na <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemesene</char> elewo lolu. Nahe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JUD 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Sowi ewe, idele inolo Godehe welu gili amofea seleba mesu. Nao Godehe, Ehe gili hameseiya amida, Kelisohe gili haguguba alebaibia amida, gili melesine welu.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Gode Ehe Ene yagunagalo manada, aeaba ofolo manada, hameselo manada, gine libo usu bulemesi moloba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe idele inolo woluda molofe amofea naga meyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Ne yagusodali, na helegeba ligia, Godehe nini sunia ua <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagolu</char> amone, gilifea seleba meyone madenefia daiyafia alolu. Auluso, aga gilifea sowi ewedale seleba meyone, dabalu dobu. Sowi aga selesu ewene kiwimo, ewe. Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyo</char> mana amo, idele inolo Edai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> melesi moloba ufulu labe amofea mesia, fogo uluse hamagi, mana amo ine sone saabia ufulu. Aulugulu, inolo noolohe asigi ule ufulu mana amo aliliba selesia besilosi, gili koleba, amone hagugusia belagumale. Gili auba aumaleba kiwigaaba saeyone, na sowi ewe gilifea seleba mesu.<verse eid="JUD 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 2:4">Gal 2.4</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:1">2Fid 2.1</ref></char>
    </note>Maumo, idele inolo noolo, Godefea faiso melu alebaibu ili amo, muguba inigia, sese usu mulu alebaibu. Ili aliliba selesia, “Gode E nini kanuluba ufulugulu, nini wolu nokene nokeneba molosia, susugu mana moloyone beega loluba,” saeyobafe. Aufia, ilihe nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Keliso waaselaba bisigia, selesia, “E nine Bisoaleba” sodo. Godene bugo samini waagi selesia, ili amo godoyoba saaba ufulu dobu.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Kis 12.51</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Nam 14.29-30</ref></char>
    </note>Gili ama asigibu amone, na gilifea obegeba asigimesi selesumo ewe. Amakelemo, Saminilo Yesuhe Isolaele mosomu Isibi helea amifia <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dulu</char>. Auluso, dufia, Ehe idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluale</char> ili amo woba dafalilu.<verse eid="JUD 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 2:4">2Fid 2.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, sulu eweda obegeba asigima. Gode Ehe hebene lagi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">sulu dia ano</char> ilifeamo dabalu meluso, noolomo woba adesi, ili ine ada amo afasia dedalelu. Ausi, Gode Ehe ilimo subulale seini amohe dofafasia, nigili gagaiya ami dibolo dafalibagolu. Ili auba dibolo yasifia ligiasu, Osolaeyo Hilia Bule amone yasifia alebaibu.<verse eid="JUD 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 19:1-25">Stt 19.1-25</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:6">2Fid 2.6</ref>, <ref loc="2PE 2:10">10</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, eweda obegeba asigima. <char style="w" lemma="Sodomo">Sodomoda</char>, Gomolada, dauno noolo aniba ami kakainabu amoda, aubasu mololu. Sulu dia ano ili ogohe wolu adesia, susugu mololuguba, dauno amone idele inolo ilida aubasu susugu mana nokene mololu. Auba molosiamo, ilihe mololalegubada susugu nonoba moloba alolu. Aulune, de usulale alefalumohe dauno aida amo nabasu labi, dauno ili amohe aga haguguba dedeba walesia, ami naga nabia dobu.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Amogubasu, idele inolo ewe, gine sese usu ami muguba milibailu ili amohe, ine udia abulu amone kuliba aasusia, domala nugumaba ofelesia, ili eleliba yaafia, wida solu labemofea golaba bolo. Aufia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleluda</char> alebailomo gaidaboba sodo. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10.13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12.1</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:11">2Fid 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">MUU 12.7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Sek 3.2</ref></char></note>Godene sulu dia ano olaibo, Maigolohe, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> domala isaloasia, <char style="w" lemma="Henane">henanedai</char> sulu hegeba selesia, ehe godosia, efea gaidaboba saeyomone, na widaleba hiliselu. Ausi, ehe efea solumo ewe. “<char style="qt">Saminilohe gafea mana saeyobafe.</char>” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:12">2Fid 2.12</ref></char></note>Auluso, idele inolo ili ogohe, kegele ili dawalobuale amone gaidaboba saeyone sagililale. Ilihe kelebulugulu asigida male adesia, domalafealosu dawalolo dulu alebaibu. Dawalolo amo alefasia, ili ine meleba woba dafelefe.<verse eid="JUD 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:7-8">Stt 4.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:12">1Yon 3.12</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:15">2Fid 2.15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:1-41">Nam 22.1-41</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">16.1-35</ref></char>
    </note>Yeele! Idele inolo ili amofea higinilu bule holobagaeyobafe. Ilihe Keini daalu eno amone kuliba dedalefe. Aufia, Balamahe heleba mololu amoguba, ilida mole dibaiyesia heleba molofe. Aufia, inolo Kolahe saminimo Mosesefea eleliluguba, ili ogohe aubasu Godefea elelife. Ausi, Kola woba dafulu amoguba, ilida woba dafiyobafe.<verse eid="JUD 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 2:13">2Fid 2.13</ref>, <ref loc="2PE 2:17">17</ref></char>
    </note>Gilihe henesia sigilo gagaiyofea ami, naiyo bule naiyone ua kakainasiamo, inolo ili ogohe gili gagaiyofe amofea nuguma baaba waalefe. Enebamo, ilihe gilidai naiyo nabiamo, yuaeyomo sagililale. Ili amomo, ine melebasu uluba miliyo asigilo. Ili amo kene yabulugulu labe. Kene yabuluso, hele hugalale. Aubale. Fufulohe ili fuuba dafolo. Aufia, i sebe helelo gi adesimo, sebe helelu labelaba boloso, sebe heleluale baafia, gelu enaohe ili duguba dafolo. Auba ausi, ili ogo i amogulu adesia, bausosi, duguba dafelesi, olasiamo, aidaba olalu. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Salu hano bule fufulesi, subu daunagalo amoguba, ilihe ine yualo mana mololo amo ulufaba daunagalo. Ili amo sigabi anakiwi gegesiale sibaisasia, noolofea eloalo amogulu labe. Nigili saooba daiya hele amo, ili ami alefalu melesi madenefia diba dobu.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:18">Stt 5.18</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Adama</char> amifia faibe sebagalu amone alegalabia mulu saladegelu domo amo, Inogo. Ehe inolo lagi solu amone iminisia, saaba ofa selesia, “Bama! Saminilo E inigia, Ene muuba kalilu sulu dia ano saii wedinale galiba, saabeba solu. <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />E inigiamo, idele inolo sunia osolaeyone miyobafe. Aufia, Efea faiso mefe idele inolo sunia, wolu sunia ili mololumo fadaba asigimesi ulufaba waleyobafe. Wolu amo, ilihe Godefea faiso meba yaafia ligia, mololu. Aufia, sulu kolelu sunia ilihe Efea solu amoda, Ehe ili fadaba asigimesi ulufaba waleyobafe.” Inogo auba saaba ufulu.<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Inolo ili ogomo gogomoba ligia, agegeba ado. Ine mesegelone hame kuliba daabasu ligia, sulu yogolelu selesiaso, mofe baleleba masega sodo. Ine meleba huliane dibaiyesia, noolofea hahanoba sodo.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gine asigi ule ufulufealomo, kolelu melale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Auluso, ne yagusodali, gili koleba, sulu nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ilihe samini ama solu, amone obegeba asigima. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2Fid 3.3</ref></char></note>Sulu ilihe gilifea saaba melu amo ewe. “Aleba eloyo hilia hagoalesimo, gaidaboba saeyo inolomo holobagagaeyobafe. Ili amo, ine mesegelo mana kuliba abia, Godefea faiso mefia, wolu molobaiyesia dedaleba yaeyobafe.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Mosomu osolaba dafalilo amo, ili koleba alebaibu. Ili amohe helefealune manasu kuliba dedalesi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekene</char> amo ilidai adale.<verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:7">Kol 2.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, ne yagusodali, gili koleba, <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> gili ulubia aasi, Godedai sulu selaba ligia, gine miliyolune molo disiamo, gine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluiya</char> ami dimale. Gine asigi ule ufulu amomo, muuba kalilu koleba labe. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Gili koleba, Godene hameselo usu ami melale. Auba ligia, Saminilo Yesu Kelisone yagunagalo amo alefasia, <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> gilifea meyobafeba asigifia, yasiba melale.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Aufia, idele inolo noolo asigi aidaba alebaibu ili amofea, yagunagasia sagoba waalemale. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Sek 3.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:4">MUU 3.4</ref></char></note>Noolomo de waiya naafea amifia gasiba dimale. Noolofea yagunagaba sagoba ofelesiamo, nafuluba! Nugumalu ili mololu amohe gilida baalosi sagilisia, ine mana amo habosia, hago melale.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe Godene wi digiba selesu</para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Gode E koleba,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:24">gilimo gelebaimesiale haguguba miliyodolu labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:24">Aufia, Ehe, gili heleba daaluda male ligia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:24">Ene olegi elaleiya ami kalugaamesi moloba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:24">Ausi, gilihe ami Efea nokene henesia ibaba miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:24">Aga nini Ene wi digima!<verse eid="JUD 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:27">Lom 16.27</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:18">2Fid 3.18</ref></char>
    </note>Ule E-su Gode labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Nine Saminilo Yesu Keliso alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Ehe ninimo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dulu</char>.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JUD 1:25" />
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Elalelu amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Kini Olaibomone wabialelo amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Kiwigagalu amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Wida solu ana koleba amoda</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Efea alefalu koleba labe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JUD 1:25" />
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Maugaba koleba, E aubasu alefalu alolu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Agada, E aubasu alefalu labe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Dufiada, E aubasu alefalu alefaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Aulune, nini koleba,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">Ene wi wabialeba selebasu ligia, alefalu melale.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JUD 1:25">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.</para>
  <para style="rem" vid="JUD 1:25">z1col-e</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:25">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="1.25" /><verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>